OL,3,GNEWSANext wins key appeal to overturn
OL,4,A#30m equal pay ruling
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter Next's appeal, the law firm Leigh
OL,7,FDay, which represents store workers,
OL,8,Fdescribed the conclusion on basic pay
OL,9,Fas "disappointing" and said it will
OL,10,Fappeal the decision.
